comment = "PF development package transition"
desc = <<EOD
This metadata-only upgrade package retires the previous netpfil/pf headers.
Current PF vendor headers are provided by clibs-dev under net/.
It keeps the historical package identity so pkg removes only files owned by
that package during a normal upgrade. No administrator policy is removed.
EOD
